            "value": "Green structural color turns into rainbow bands as the shell rotates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绿色结构色与转动时的彩虹条带，本演示混合两种光谱查表"
